MODULE: NoSelfSustainingBacklogReplacementQueuesAgain
TARGET: NoSelfSustainingBacklog
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a replacement client queues another owner beside its live shared barrier
PERTURBS: ClientReplacement

--- FIND
    /\ deadline' = [deadline EXCEPT ![r] = RequestBudget]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<holders, free, withheld, queue, status, role, observed,
        pressure, pressurePhase, drain, hung, holdLeft, frontier, banked,
        checkpoint, holes, ledger, opportunity, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch, cancelled>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ deadline' = [deadline EXCEPT ![r] = RequestBudget]
    /\ queue' = IF status[r] = "queued" THEN Append(queue, r) ELSE queue
    /\ UNCHANGED <<holders, free, withheld, status, role, observed,
        pressure, pressurePhase, drain, hung, holdLeft, frontier, banked,
        checkpoint, holes, ledger, opportunity, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch, cancelled>>
--- END
